capability md/depth  how deep block quotes and lists may nest, and no stack to overflow
  heroes  markdown.Options.max_depth, markdown.DEFAULT_MAX_DEPTH
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  -
  note    markers past the depth are read as text; nothing recurses on the data, so a deep document cannot overflow the stack, and a link destination nests at most 32 parentheses, cmark's limit, so that a line of unclosed links reads in linear time

