dropped
  go      DefaultRenderer, DefaultParser: constructors of the configurable parts; md/configure
  go      ast.MergeOrAppendTextSegment, ast.MergeOrReplaceTextSegment, ast.Attribute: goldmark's own text segments into its source buffer and attribute lists
  rust    comrak::version, comrak::Options, the `Comrak*` type aliases, comrak::ExtensionOptions.description_lists' and the other options' builders: the crate's own version and configuration plumbing
  rust    pulldown_cmark::InvalidHeadingLevel: the error of a conversion from a number; a heading's level here is a number
  python  markdown_it.common, markdown_it.helpers, markdown_it.main, markdown_it.parser_block, markdown_it.parser_core, markdown_it.parser_inline, markdown_it.presets, markdown_it.renderer, markdown_it.ruler, markdown_it.rules_block, markdown_it.rules_core, markdown_it.rules_inline, markdown_it.token, markdown_it.utils: the modules the package is made of
